  "version": "1",
  "text": "You are wearing a tailored grey blazer with sharp lapels and clean lines, paired with a matching light grey midi skirt that has a subtle rear slit for ease of movement. A sleek tan leather belt cinches your waist to highlight your natural shape, while classic blue suede loafers add a touch of softness and quiet elegance. You carry a structured black handbag with a smooth finish that complements the entire ensemble without overpowering it.",
  "how_to_wear": [
    "Tuck the blazer in slightly at the front to emphasize your waist, especially when seated during the service or conversation."
  ],
